li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; font-family: \" josefin=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 700;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 1.3;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 36px;=\"\" clear:=\"\" both;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\" segoe=\"\" ui\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;\"=\"\">Mewujudkan kemandirian dalam menjalankan hak dan kewajiban antara perusahaan dan pemerintah.</span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; font-family: \" josefin=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 700;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 1.3;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 36px;=\"\" clear:=\"\" both;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\" segoe=\"\" ui\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;\"=\"\">Membantu menumbuhkan kesadaran dan kepatuhan pajak di dalam masyarakat.</span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; font-family: \" josefin=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 700;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 1.3;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 36px;=\"\" clear:=\"\" both;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\" segoe=\"\" ui\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;\"=\"\">Melakukan pendidikan, pengembangan dan pelatihan bagi calon profesional muda yang memiliki komptensi praktik dibidang akuntansi, manajemen, perpajakan, dan perbankan</span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 15px; font-family: \" josefin=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 700;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 1.3;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 36px;=\"\" clear:=\"\" both;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\" segoe=\"\" ui\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" color:=\"\" inherit;\"=\"\">Menjadikan HTC sebagai tax agent di bidang perpajakan melalui pembinaan berkelanjutan terhadap Wajib Pajak</span></li></ul><p></p>','2021-08-12','','admin',362,'03:03:59','Kamis'),(54,'Direktur HTC | Training and Consulting','direktur-htc--training-and-consulting','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24px;\"><img src=\"https://pusatpelatihanpajak.com/asset/images/direktur.jpg\" style=\"width: 556px;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 1rem; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\"><br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 1rem; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\"><u>Direktur<br></u></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-size: 1rem; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">Hersona Bangun, SH.,SE.,AK.,BKP.,CA.,M.Ak.,CLA.,Asean CPA.,CPCLE.,CCCLE</span></h2><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24px;\"><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(75,=\"\" 75,=\"\" 75);=\"\" background-image:=\"\" initial;=\"\" background-position:=\"\" background-size:=\"\" background-repeat:=\"\" background-attachment:=\"\" background-origin:=\"\" background-clip:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24px; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\"><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(75,=\"\" 75,=\"\" 75);=\"\" background-image:=\"\" initial;=\"\" background-position:=\"\" background-size:=\"\" background-repeat:=\"\" background-attachment:=\"\" background-origin:=\"\" background-clip:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">Adalah lulusan SI di Fakultas Ekonomi Jurusan Akuntansi Universitas Gadjah Mada, SI Fakultas Hukum Universitas Janabadra Yogyakarta dan juga Lulusan Magister Akuntansi Ull (Konsentrasi Perpajakan), menyelesaikan Pendidikan Profesi di Ull dan Pendidikan Profesi Advokat di Universitas Gadjah Mada. Telah menangani akuntansi dan perpajakan berbagai perusahaan seperti perusahaan dagang, manufaktur, perbankan, jasa konstruksi dan rumah sakit.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\"><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(75,=\"\" 75,=\"\" 75);=\"\" background-image:=\"\" initial;=\"\" background-position:=\"\" background-size:=\"\" background-repeat:=\"\" background-attachment:=\"\" background-origin:=\"\" background-clip:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24px; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">Hersona Bangun merupakan Konsultan Pajak Berijin, Advokat dan Pengacara Pajak dan juga Staff Pengajar Perpajakan di Lingkungan Universitas Gadjah Mada serta pengajar Brevet Pajak di beberapa Universitas di Yogyakarta seperti, UGM, UPN eteran, AA Y KPN, STIE AMM Lombok Mataram dan&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">—Perguruan tinggi lainnya.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px; background: rgb(252, 252, 252); vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(75, 75, 75); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"CDt4Ke zfr3Q\" style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline: none; position: relative; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 13pt; text-decoration-line: inherit; font-family: Roboto; line-height: 1.38; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";\"=\"\">SERTIFIKAT</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"CDt4Ke zfr3Q\" style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline: none; position: relative; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 13pt; text-decoration-line: inherit; font-family: Roboto; line-height: 1.38; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; padding: 0px 0px 0px 7pt; text-indent: -7pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\">-  Sertifikasi Legal Auditor Tahun 2019 Certified Legal Auditor (CLA) Sertifikat Nomor 74110 2511 0001494 2019</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"CDt4Ke zfr3Q\" style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline: none; position: relative; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 13pt; text-decoration-line: inherit; font-family: Roboto; line-height: 1.38; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; padding: 0px 0px 0px 7pt; text-indent: -7pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\">-  Sertif