 serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 12pt;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 12pt;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"><br></span></p>','2021-08-20','','admin',220,'11:13:55','Jumat'),(57,'Layanan Pembukuan','layanan-pembukuan','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: 24px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#4b4b4b\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24px;\">Mamberikan Jasa Penyusunan Pembukuan sesuai dengan Standar Akuntansi yang berlaku di Indonesia<o:p></o:p></span></li><li><span times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";color:#4b4b4b;mso-ansi-language:en-us;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px;\">Memberikan Jasa penyusunan pembukuan berbasis computer dengan menggunakan software&nbsp;<i>Zahir Accounting</i></span></li></ul>','2021-08-20','','admin',206,'11:14:35','Jumat'),(58,'Layanan Aplikasi / Software','layanan-aplikasi--software','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img src=\"https://pusatpelati