ialiased; font-family: Tahoma;\">SPT PPh OP Suami dan Istri yang mempunyai NPWP yang berbeda atau Penggabungan NPWP</span></span></h5><h2 id=\"h.o9ul112ibw\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"CDt4Ke zfr3Q JYVBee\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none; margin: 45pt 0px 19pt; outline: none; position: relative; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 28pt; font-style: inherit; text-decoration: inherit; font-family: Roboto; line-height: 1.38; padding: 0px; pointer-events: none; background-color: transparent; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"></h2></div></div></div></div>','2021-11-05','','admin',162,'15:43:10','Jumat'),(64,'Teknisi Perpajakan','teknisi-perpajakan','<h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><img src=\"https://pusatpelatihanpajak.com/asset/images/WhatsApp_Image_2022-05-23_at_09_24_54.jpeg\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem; width: 870.406px;\"><br></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><b style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\">SEKILAS PROGRAM PELATIHAN KERJA TEKNISI PERPAJAKAN</b><br></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Pelatihan\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">K</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">erja </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Teknisi Perpajakan </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">merupakan\r\n<i>Great &amp; Excellent Program</i> (GEP)\r\nyang dirancang untuk memberikan, memperoleh, meningkatkan, serta mengembangkan\r\nkompetensi kerja, produktivitas, disiplin, sikap, dan etos kerja pada tingkat\r\nketerampilan dan keahlian di bidang Perpajakan sesuai dengan kebutuhan dunia\r\nkerja. Program ini adalah proses mengajarkan pengetahuan dan pengembangan\r\nketerampilan bekerja <i>(vocational)</i>\r\nserta sikap agar para siswa semakin terampil dan mampu melaksanakan tugas dan\r\ntanggungjawabnya sebagai staff staff pajak dengan semakin baik sesuai dengan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">dengan peraturan perpajakan </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">yang\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">berlaku</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">. Dalam waktu </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">6 (enam) bulan </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">maka seluruh siswa\r\nyang mengikuti pelatihan kerja Perpajakan ini akan dapat menyusun laporan pajak\r\nbaik untuk orang pribadi maupun badan sehingga siap untuk ditempatkan dan menjalankan\r\naktivitasnya sebagai Staff</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\"> </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Staff\r\nPajak.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\"> Selain itu peserta juga akan dibekali dengan\r\nKeterampilan Akuntansi dan Bahasa Inggris untuk mendukung pekerjaannya.</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\"><br><o:p></o:p></span><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">STAFF PENGAJAR<br></span></b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Metode\r\nPengajaran:<br><o:p></o:p></span><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Metode\r\nPengajaran</span></b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">: <i>Tutorial,\r\nVisual presentations, Conferences dan discussion, Case studies, Role playing,\r\nSimulation, Programmed instruction, Computer-based training, Laboratory\r\ntraining, Programmed group exercise,</i> <i>Studie\r\nField.<br></i><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memiliki\r\nKemampuan <i>Transfer Knowledge</i> yang secara\r\nkomprehensif.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Dosen/Praktisi\r\nyang sudah berpengalaman dibidang akuntansi dan perpajakan yang terdiri dari:<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" tahoma\"=\"\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Konsultan Pajak<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" tahoma\"=\"\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Kuasa Hukum Pajak<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" tahoma\"=\"\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-fa