 style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Setiap\r\nsiswa akan diikutsertakan dalam program pemagangan pajak sebelum ditempatkan\r\ndiperusahaan penerima kerja.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memberikan\r\npendampingan kepada siswa dalam pemecahan masalah yang terjadi di selama </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">6 (enam) bulan.<br></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memberikan\r\nPelatihan Perpajakan kepada lulusan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC\r\nTraining &amp; Consulting</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"> dalam rangka Update\r\nPeraturan terbaru.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Melatih\r\nsoftskill siswa melalui konsep praktek langsung<br> <o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Melatih\r\nsiswa untuk bekerjasama, membangun komunikasi, keberanian dengan konsep diskusi.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Melatih\r\nsiswa untuk membantu menyelesaikan kasus-kasus perpajakan.</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"><br><o:p></o:p></span><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">UJI</span></b><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ans