e:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;<br></span><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">UNIT AKTIVITAS SISWA<br></span></b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Untuk\r\nmeningkatkan kemampuan berkomunikasi, bersosialisasi dan bekerjasama membentuk\r\nForum Diskusi Pajak dan Forum Diskusi Akuntansi yang akan membahas berbagai\r\nkasus perpajakan dan akuntansi yang <i>up to\r\ndate.<br></i><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memberikan\r\npengalaman berorganisasi dengan mahasiswa di perguruan tinggi<br><o:p></o:p></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Meningkatkan\r\nkompetensi dan wawasan keilmuan diluar pembelajaran<o:p></o:p></span><o:wrapblock><v:shape id=\"Picture_x0020_2\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;text-align:left;margin-left:246pt;\r\n  margin-top:18.45pt;width:292.3pt;height:164.55pt;z-index:251665408;\r\n  visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-width-percent:0;\r\n  mso-height-percent:0;mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;mso-wrap-distance-top:0;\r\n  mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;\r\n  mso-position-horizontal:absolute;mso-position-horizontal-relative:text;\r\n  mso-position-vertical:absolute;mso-position-vertical-relative:text;\r\n  mso-width-percent:0;mso-height-percent:0;mso-width-relative:margin;\r\n  mso-height-relative:margin\"><v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\HTC\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\msohtmlclip1\\01\\clip_image001.png\" o:title=\"\">\r\n </v:imagedata></v:shape></o:wrapblock><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><br><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC </span><i style=\"\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">RECRUITMENT\r\n&amp; PLACEMENT CENTRE</span></i><i style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\"> (HUMAN CENTRE)</span></i></b></span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Proses Penempatan Kerja</span></b><br><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">memiliki\r\nsatu divisi penempatan kerja yaitu </span><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC </span></i><i><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Recruitment\r\n&amp; Placement Centre (</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HUMAN CENTRE</span></i><i><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">).</span></i><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"> Maksud dan tujuan dari\r\nunit ini selain melakukan proses rekruitmen juga melakukan proses penempatan\r\nkerja bagi lulusan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Teknisi Perpajakan</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">.\r\nDivisi ini juga akan memastikan bahwa siswa yang akan ditempatkan bekerja di\r\nperusahaan adalah siswa yang memiliki kompetensi susuai dengan kebutuhan perusahaan.\r\n<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Tahap\r\nsebelum penempatan adalah melakukan pembekalan awal berupa, pembuatan CV,\r\nteknik wawancara dan negosiasi gaji</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">RELASI PERUSAHAAN</span></b><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Didukung\r\nberbagai perusahaan relasi diseluruh Indonesia<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memiliki\r\njaringan yang luas dengan konsultan pajak di Indonesia.<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Memiliki\r\njaringan luas dengan perusahaan yang membutuhkan staff pajak<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">MEDIA PEMBELAJARAN</span></b><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Modul\r\n<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Peraturan\r\nPerpajakan <o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Kertas\r\nKerja <o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Formulir-formulir\r\nPerpajakan <o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Software\r\nPerpajakan <o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Sofware\r\nAkuntansi<o:p></o:p></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:tahoma\"=\"\">7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Magang\r\nKerja<o:p></o:p></span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">JAMINAN KERJA </span></b><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Setiap\r\nLulusan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Teknisi Perpajakan </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">mendapat\r\njaminan penempatan kerja. Siswa siswa yang sudah bekerja akan mendapat\r\npendampingan dari </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp;\r\nConsulting </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">untuk menyelesaikan berbagai permasalahan\r\nyang berkaitan dengan pekerjaannya. Siswa yang bekerja akan ditempatkan\r\nberdasarkan kebutuhan yang ada di dalam perusahaan sesuai dengan kompetensi dan\r\nkapabilitasnya masing-masing. Prose magang akan menjadi jembatan bagi peserta\r\nuntuk masuk di dunia kerja.<b><br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before:always\"></b></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"><b>\r\nKURIKULUM PRAKTIS</b></span><br><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">Pendidikan\r\ndi </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">,\r\nmenggunakan kurikulum yang telah disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan kerja. Dengan kurikulum\r\nini, para siswa langsung dapat mengaplikasikan ilmu yang diperoleh pada saat\r\npelatihan kerja. Lulusan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Teknisi Perpajakan</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">\r\nakan terbiasa dengan berbagai dokumen dan hal-hal yang praktis selama melakukan\r\npelatihan sehingga tidak membutuhkan adaptasi yang lama dalam dunia kerja.</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">LULUSAN YANG BERKUALITAS</span></b><br><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">\r\nmemiliki standar kelulusan yang menghasilkan siswa yang memiliki etos kerja\r\nyang memahami dan menghayati nilai-nilai kejujuran, integritas, dan memiliki kompetensi\r\nkerja baik secara teoritis maupun praktis.</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">KERJASAMA INSTANSI</span></b><br><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">sebagai\r\npusat pengembangan pelatihan pajak terbesar di DIY memiliki mitra dalam penempatan\r\nkerja bagi lulusanya. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp;\r\nConsulting </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">terus menjalin kemitraan dengan berbagai\r\ninstansi dan perusahaan, baik skala lokal maupun nasional.</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span><br><b><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\"\"=\"\">BERPENGALAMAN DIBIDANG\r\nPERPAJAKAN</span></b><br><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">HTC\r\nTraining &amp; Consulting </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:in;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">sebagai pusat pengembangan dan\r\npelatihan pajak yang terbesar di DIY, memiliki pengalaman dalam dunia pendidikan\r\ndan pelatihan. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:in;mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">\r\ndipercaya sebagai tempat Pemagangan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:en-us;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">Kampus di Yogyakarta seperti\r\nUIN, UGM, UTY, Univ. Janabadra, Universitas Tidar, UII dan kampus lainnya </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:in;mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">dan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">juga\r\nsebagai tempat pemagangan </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:in;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">Pajak Brevet A dan B </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-fareast-language:in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">Universitas\r\nIslam Indonesia </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:in;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">dan merupakan mitra perusahaan yang siap untuk\r\nmenerima lulusan </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:\" tahoma\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" in;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">HTC Training &amp; Consulting</span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bolder; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; text-align: left;\">PESERTA TEKNISI PERPAJAKAN</span><br></h4><h4 style=\"font-family: \" source=\"\" sans=\"\" pro\",=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" text-align:=\"\" justify;\"=\"\"><ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 20px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 7.5pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lulusan SMA/SMK sederajat,&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: 7.5pt;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 4.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">DIploma</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-